						<p class="pDate">Thursday, August 07, 2003</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Ssra Emp goes down with NO bane weapons 
						</p>
						<p class=pText>
						Wednesday evening Necessary Evil entered the dreaded Emperor's chamber in Ssra Temple.  Yes, we were aware of the fact that bane weapons were not working.  We killed the Blood of Ssra and then proceded to take out the EMP himself while having NO dammage from melee weapons.  Pure proc and magic kill on the EMP.  I believe this is a Server first if not a EQ first.  This was also NE's FIRST EMP kill and only our second attempt at the mob.
						<br>
						 - Kudelini<BR><BR>
						</p>
						<p class="sHeader">Comments</p>
						
							<p class="pDate">Sunday, August 10, 2003</p>
							
							<p class="pTitle">hello 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							im sorry, were you waiting for me to give a damn?
							<br>
							 - noone<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">not quite 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							grats on emp.. but many guilds on many servers have killed both seru and emp without using bane weapons. yelling serverwide first just makes you look silly
							<br>
							 - -<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">LOL 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							Nah, just waiting on you to spend your time commenting that you don't:p
							<br>
							 - Lumenus<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">not even close to EQ first 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							that wasn't even close to a serverwide first, several other guilds had taken him out already, and even if your whole guild has bane weapons thats approx 1/4 the damage done to emp, the rest is from pets and casters, always is, bane or no banes
							<br>
							 - anon1<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">thanks 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							so much love ^^
							<br>
							 - Lleandar<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">grats 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							I guess some people just can't say anything nice, eh?  You could tell them that you discovered the cure for cancer and AIDS, all in one night, and they would say some bullshit.<BR><BR>Grats!
							<br>
							 - anon<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">... 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							Well, NE isn't really the nicest bunch of people out there anyway, probably why there is so much animosity.<BR><BR>Of course, that's an idiotic debate in, and of itself...<BR><BR>Oh well, who cares?
							<br>
							 - /shrug<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Grats guys 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							Well mostly everyone on this site who critized remained anon...goes to show how much balls some ppl have...heh. Well just saying grats you guys, even tho many other ppl have taken out emp with hardly any bane. Two thumbs up - you guys got him on 2nd attem
							<br>
							 - Chinsu<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
